%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as CLI
  participant P1 as agent-plane
  participant P2 as PostgreSQL
  participant P3 as vmagent
  participant P4 as Command
  P0->>P1: cancel X1
  P4->>P3: exit 0
  Note over P3: journal: exit 0
  P1->>P3: cancel X1
  P3->>P1: already finished: exit 0
  P1->>P2: X1 succeeded
  P1->>P0: outcome: exit 0
  Note over P0,P4: other order: the cancel arrives first
  P0->>P1: cancel X1
  P1->>P3: cancel X1
  P3->>P4: kill group
  P4->>P3: group gone
  Note over P3: journal: cancelled
  P3->>P1: cancelled, verified
  P1->>P2: X1 cancelled
  P1->>P0: outcome: cancelled
